		{
			"id":"8b6c133fedcee2ad",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Clock Puzzle Theories\nBased on these clues I gathered, it seems that instead this puzzle is related to the CASTLE WORD PUZZLE, if we interpret each square as a letter, then it should be something like:\n```\nCIX\nADD\nSIX\nTOR\nLOR\nE_T\n```\n\n\nI am not sure if C__ should be CAT because vertically it fits as well, the could be the one after the cat or the last letter of the puzzle.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-8000,
			"y":4049,
			"width":560,
			"height":731
		},
