		{
			"id":"b784343016d431b6",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Rooms Checked for Hidden Letters in a Grid\n\n[[001 - The Foundation.canvas|001 - The Foundation]]\n[[002 - Entrance Hall.canvas|002 - Entrance Hall]]\n[[003 - Spare Room.canvas|003 - Spare Room]]\n[[005 - Parlor.canvas|005 - Parlor]]\n[[006 - Billiard Room.canvas|006 - Billiard Room]]\n\n[[011 - Attic.canvas|011 - Attic]]\n[[012 - Storeroom.canvas|012 - Storeroom]]\n[[013 - Nook.canvas|013 - Nook]]\n[[014 - Garage.canvas|014 - Garage]]\n[[015 - Music Room.canvas|015 - Music Room]]\n**[[016 - Locker Room.canvas|016 - Locker Room]]**\n[[017 - Den.canvas|017 - Den]]\n[[019 - Trophy Room.canvas|019 - Trophy Room]]\n[[020 - Ballroom.canvas|020 - Ballroom]]\n[[022 - Rumpus Room.canvas|022 - Rumpus Room]]\n**[[023 - Vault.canvas|023 - Vault]]**\n[[025 - Drawing Room.canvas|025 - Drawing Room]]\n[[026 - Study.canvas|026 - Study]]\n[[030 - Drafting Studio.canvas|030 - Drafting Studio]]\n[[031 - Utility Closet.canvas|031 - Utility Closet]]\n[[034 - Security.canvas|034 - Security]]\n[[036 - Laboratory.canvas|036 - Laboratory]]\n[[038 - Coat Check.canvas|038 - Coat Check]]\n[[040 - Freezer.canvas|040 - Freezer]]\n[[041 - Dining Room.canvas|041 - Dining Room]]\n[[042 - Observatory.canvas|042 - Observatory]]\n[[043 - Conference Room.canvas|043 - Conference Room]]\n[[044 - Aquarium.canvas|044 - Aquarium]]\n\n[[Archives.canvas|Archives]]\n**[[Blackbridge Grotto.canvas|Blackbridge Grotto]]**\n[[Bedroom.canvas|Bedroom]]\n[[Bookshop.canvas|Bookshop]]\n[[Bunk Room.canvas|Bunk Room]]\n[[Chapel.canvas|Chapel]]\n[[Classroom.canvas|Classroom]] 1'\n[[Clock Tower.canvas|Clock Tower]]\n**[[Cloister.canvas|Cloister]]**\n[[Commissary.canvas|Commissary]]\n[[Conservatory.canvas|Conservatory]]\n[[Corridor.canvas|Corridor]]\n[[Courtyard.canvas|Courtyard]]\n[[Foyer.canvas|Foyer]]\n[[Furnace.canvas|Furnace]]\n[[Gymnasium.canvas|Gymnasium]]\n[[Hallway.canvas|Hallway]]\n[[Lavatory.canvas|Lavatory]]\n[[Maid's Chamber.canvas|Maid's Chamber]]\n[[Nursery.canvas|Nursery]]\n[[Passageway.canvas|Passageway]]\n[[Planetarium.canvas|Planetarium]]\n[[Servant's Quarters.canvas|Servant's Quarters]]\n**[[Secret Passage.canvas|Secret Passage]]**\n[[Shelter.canvas|Shelter]]\n[[Showroom.canvas|Showroom]]\n[[Terrace.canvas|Terrace]]\n[[The Armory.canvas|The Armory]]\n**[[The Kennel.canvas|The Kennel]]**\n**[[The Precipice.canvas|The Precipice]]**\n**[[Tomb.canvas|Tomb]]**\n[[Veranda.canvas|Veranda]]\n[[Weight Room.canvas|Weight Room]]\n\n\n",
			"styleAttributes":{},
